 # Static support boundaries
 
 This project isolates open tool maps, helper-built session instructions, initialization-sensitive subclasses, and ordinary function-tool delegation outside Cloudflare AIChatAgent's supported static relationships.
+
+## Static evidence limits
+
+- `support` retains its direct runtime-agent and instruction-loader bindings, but its complete request tool set remains unresolved until closed wiring or runtime evidence replaces the runtime-selected spread.
+- `step-support` retains only its runtime-agent binding; its effective instruction provenance remains unresolved until closed `prepareStep` behavior or runtime evidence proves one loader.
+- `delegating-support` has a proved ordinary function-tool relationship, not a handoff or routing target. Indirect generation, array output, and initialization-sensitive classes remain unregistered.
+
+Cloudflare runtime and deployment responsibilities are recorded in `/docs/cloudflare-runtime.md`.

